<title>USA: Price says has no Reader's Digest stake.</title>
<headline>Price says has no Reader's Digest stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Money manager Michael Price Friday denied rumors that his mutual funds have taken a stake in Reader's Digest Association Inc.</p>
<p>In a brief interview with Reuters, Price said his funds own &quot;not one share&quot; of the stock.</p>
<p>Rumors swirled through the market that Price had taken a position in the giant magazine and book publisher.</p>
<p>Price's Mutual Series funds are owned by Franklin Resources Inc's Franklin-Templeton funds.</p>
